Rem AMCAF's sound effects: Pt Raw Play, Pt Sam Play, Pt Free Voice, Pt Sam Stop with the player's block (the golden is the original library's)
Reserve As Chip Data 6,2000
For I=0 To 1999 : Poke Start(6)+I,(I*5) mod 256 : Next I
Reserve As Chip Data 7,600
T=Start(7)
Fill T To T+600,0
Doke T,2 : Loke T+2,10 : Loke T+6,40
Doke T+18,8000 : Loke T+20,200
Doke T+48,16000 : Loke T+50,160
For I=0 To 199 : Poke T+24+I,I : Next I
Pt Sam Bank 7
Pt Cia Speed 0
DB=Pt Data Base
Pt Voice 15
Gosub XQ
Print #1,"free";Pt Free Voice(15);Pt Free Voice(3);Pt Free Voice(8);Pt Free Voice(0);Pt Free Voice(5)
Pt Raw Play 1,Start(6),1000,8000
Gosub XQ
Print #1,"free";Pt Free Voice(15);Pt Free Voice(3);Pt Free Voice(1);Pt Free Voice(7)
For F=1 To 12 : Wait Vbl : Gosub XQ : Next F
Print #1,"sam"
Pt Sam Play 2
Gosub XQ
Pt Sam Play 4,-1
Gosub XQ
Pt Sam Play 8,2,10000
Gosub XQ
Print #1,"free";Pt Free Voice(15);Pt Free Voice(6);Pt Free Voice(14);Pt Free Voice(1)
Pt Sam Volume 8,20 : Pt Sam Freq 4,12000 : Pt Sam Volume 33
Pt Sam Stop 6
Gosub XQ
For F=1 To 30 : Wait Vbl : Next F
Gosub XQ
Print #1,"raw loop"
Pt Raw Play 3,Start(6),-400,9000
Gosub XQ
For F=1 To 5 : Wait Vbl : Next F
Pt Sam Stop 15
Gosub XQ
Print #1,"negative"
Pt Raw Play -3,Start(6),400,9000
Pt Raw Play -3,Start(6),400,9000
Gosub XQ
Pt Raw Play 0,Start(6),400,9000
Pt Raw Play 8,Start(6),0,9000
Pt Raw Play 8,Start(6),20000,99999
Gosub XQ
For F=1 To 100 : Wait Vbl : Next F
Gosub XQ
Pt Stop
Print #1,"stopped";Pt Data Base-DB
Goto FIN
XQ:
Print #1,"s";Peek(DB+14);Peek(DB+15);Peek(DB+16);Peek(DB+17);Deek(DB+18);Deek(DB+20);Deek(DB+22);Deek(DB+24)
Return
FIN:
